:"١٤","location":"64:14:19","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Ey inananlar! Eşleriniz ve çocuklarınızdan size düşmanlık edenler olur, onlardan sakının; ama, siz affeder, suçlarını örter ve bağışlarsanız bilin ki Allah da bağışlar ve acır.","transliteration":"yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū inna min azwājikum wa-awlādikum ʿaduwwan lakum fa-iḥ'dharūhum wa-in taʿfū wataṣfaḥū wataghfirū fa-inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun"},{"id":5214,"verse_key":"64:15","verse_number":15,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","location":"64:15:1","transliteration":{"text":"innamā"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلُكُمْ","location":"64:15:2","transliteration":{"text":"amwālukum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَأَوْلَـٰدُكُمْ","location":"64:15:3","transliteration":{"text":"wa-awlādukum"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فِتْنَةٌۭ ۚ","location":"64:15:4","transliteration":{"text":"fit'natun"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","location":"64:15:5","transliteration":{"text":"wal-lahu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عِندَهُۥٓ","location":"64:15:6","transliteration":{"text":"ʿindahu"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"أَجْرٌ","location":"64:15:7","transliteration":{"text":"ajrun"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌۭ","location":"64:15:8","transliteration":{"text":"ʿaẓīmun"}},{"char_type_name":"end","text_uthmani":"١٥","location":"64:15:9","transliteration":{"text":null}}],"translation":"Doğrusu mallarınız ve çocuklarınız bir imtihandır. Büyük ecir ise Allah katındadır.","transliteration":"innamā amwālukum wa-awlādukum fit'natun wal-lahu ʿindahu ajrun ʿaẓīmun"},{"id":5215,"verse_key":"64:16","verse_number":16,"words":[{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَٱتَّقُوا۟","location":"64:16:1","transliteration":{"text":"fa-ittaqū"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","location":"64:16:2","transliteration":{"text":"l-laha"}},{"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani